{"title": "Magic Club", "pageid": 4418, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Magic_Club", "categories": ["Damage Rider As Source", "Bugs", "Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Magical.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/Generic_Magical.webp/300px-Generic_Magical.webp, /w/images/c/c6/Generic_Magical.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/Generic_Magical.webp/300px-Generic_Magical.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c6/Generic_Magical.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Magic Club</b> is a passive feature applied to <a href=\"/wiki/Twisting_Branch\" title=\"Twisting Branch\">Twisting Branches</a> clubs carried by <a href=\"/wiki/Wood_Woad\" title=\"Wood Woad\">Wood Woads</a>. It causes the clubs to become magical weapons and deal extra damage.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>In the <a href=\"/wiki/Wood_Woad\" title=\"Wood Woad\">Wood Woad's</a> hand, a common <a href=\"/wiki/Club\" title=\"Club\">club</a> becomes magical and deals <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">3d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bludgeoning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">Bludgeoning</span></a><abbr title=\"Damage Rider As Source\" class=\"bg3wiki-damage-rider-source\"><a href=\"/wiki/Damage_rider_as_source\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage rider as source\">DRS</a></abbr> damage extra. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Wood_Woad\" title=\"Wood Woad\">Wood Woad</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>This effect is not applied to the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Twisting_Branch\" title=\"Twisting Branch\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/Wood_Woad_Twisting_Branch_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Wood_Woad_Twisting_Branch_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0f/Wood_Woad_Twisting_Branch_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Wood_Woad_Twisting_Branch_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0f/Wood_Woad_Twisting_Branch_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Wood_Woad_Twisting_Branch_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/Wood_Woad_Twisting_Branch_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Wood_Woad_Twisting_Branch_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0f/Wood_Woad_Twisting_Branch_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Twisting_Branch\" title=\"Twisting Branch\">Twisting Branch</a> that can be acquired as normal loot.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Due to a coding error, the 3d4 extra damage from this feature is not magical despite the description saying it is.</li>\n<li>The 3d4 extra damage applies to <i>all</i> melee attack rolls instead of just weapon attacks, and it will trigger twice if dual-wielded. Most <a href=\"/wiki/Damage_mechanics\" title=\"Damage mechanics\">damage riders</a> also stack with each instance of this damage.</li></ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203225\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.039 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.045 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1099/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 9205/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5435/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 21/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 130/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 640389/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   36.625      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   36.625      1 -total\n 31.39%   11.497      1 Template:DamageText\n 26.49%    9.701      1 Template:Damage_type\n 25.66%    9.397      1 Template:Icon_link\n 25.58%    9.367     13 Template:Trim\n 24.77%    9.072      1 Template:Icon_text\n 21.18%    7.758      3 Template:Ifempty\n 17.00%    6.226      1 Template:RarityItem\n 15.14%    5.545      1 Template:Item_icon\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idh